    "title": "בִּרְכַּת כֹּהֲנִים:  נְשִׂיאַת כַּפַּיִם | Birkat Kohanim: Nesíăt Kăpăyim hand gesture as displayed in Unicode and CSS (WordPress plugin by Aharon Varady)",
    "author": "Aharon N. Varady",
    "coauthors": [
        {
            "name": "Aharon N. Varady",
            "bio": "Aharon Varady is the founding director of the Open Siddur Project. A community planner (M.C.P, <a href=\"http://daap.uc.edu/\">DAAP</a>/University of Cincinnati.) and Jewish educator (M.A.J.Ed., the <a href=\"https://www.jtsa.edu/school/davidson-graduate-school-of-jewish-education/\">William Davidson School of Education</a>), his work in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Open_Source_Judaism\">open-source Judaism</a> has been written about in the <a href=\"http://yiddish.forward.com/articles/214255/make-your-own-siddur/\">Yiddish Forverts</a>, the <a href=\"http://www.theatlantic.com/technology/archive/2012/06/the-potential-and-promise-of-open-source-judaism/258394/\">Atlantic Magazine</a>, <a href=\"http://www.tabletmag.com/jewish-life-and-religion/21498/prayer-unbound\">Tablet</a>, and <a href=\"http://www.haaretz.com/prayer-ala-carte-1.279328\">Haaretz</a>. If you find any egregious mistakes in his work, please <a href=\"/contact/\">let him know</a>. <em>Shgiyot mi yavin; Ministarot naqeni</em> <span lang=\"he\" class=\"scribe\">שְׁגִיאוֹת מִי־יָבִין; מִנִּסְתָּרוֹת נַקֵּנִי</span> \"Who can know all one's flaws? From hidden errors, correct me\" (Psalms 19:13). If you'd like to directly support his work, please consider donating via his <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/aharonium\">Patreon account</a>. (Varady also <a href=\"/profile/aharon-varady-transcription/\">transcribes</a> and <a href=\"/profile/aharon-varady-translation/\">translates</a> prayers, besides serving as the primary <em>shammes</em> of the Open Siddur Project.)",
            "website": "https://aharon.varady.net",
            "avatar": "https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/Aharon-Varady-2002.jpg",
            "profile_link": "https://opensiddur.org/profile/aharon-varady"
        }
    ],
    "date": "2026-09-01",
    "last_updated": "2026-09-25",
    "excerpt": "A Wordpress plugin that renders the Unicode character \"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulcan_salute\">Vulcan Salute</a>\" (U+1F596) together with its mirror image as inline, bidi-safe <span> markup -- in order to display, via shortcode, the traditional <em>nesíăt kapayim</em> (\"lifting of the hands\") gesture used by Kohanim during the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Priestly_Blessing\">Birkat Kohanim</a> (a/k/a <em>dukhenen</em>) service. The display defaults to showing both hands side by side (right hand before left hand, thumbs facing inward), however, either hand alone is also selectable. Supports full-color emoji vs. line-art (\"vs15\") rendering, and fluid display sizing via CSS clamp(), if desired. Skin tone is available from light to medium to dark with 'medium-light' and 'medium-dark' also available.\r\n",
    "content": "<p><strong>Download:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/aharonium/opensiddur.org/tree/89145fd6b7d8eef5cd47a546a62a54188aa4ab58/plugins/custom-vulcan-salute\">PHP</a></p>\n<p>A WordPress plugin that renders the Unicode character &#8220;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vulcan_salute\">Vulcan Salute</a>&#8221; (U+1F596) together with its mirror image as inline, bidi-safe <span> markup &#8212; in order to display, via shortcode, the traditional <em>nesíăt kapayim</em> (&#8220;lifting of the hands&#8221;) gesture used by Kohanim during the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Priestly_Blessing\">Birkat Kohanim</a> (a/k/a <em>dukhenen</em>) service. The display defaults to showing both hands side by side (right hand before left hand, thumbs facing inward), however, either hand alone is also selectable. Supports full-color emoji vs. line-art (&#8220;vs15&#8221;) rendering, and fluid display sizing via CSS clamp(), if desired. Skin tone is available from light to medium to dark with &#8216;medium-light&#8217; and &#8216;medium-dark&#8217; also available.</p>\n<p>Currently, the plugin will display the emoji/line-art using whatever font you&#8217;ve defined for your site, else it will default to whatever the rendering browser/Operating System is set to display. (A future feature will provide an option to display the hand gestures according to specific glyphs offered in a set of fonts.)</p>\n<p>Examples:</p>\n<p>emoji (default): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing hand gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:inherit\">🖖️</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:inherit;margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖️</span></span></p>\n<p>vs15 (rendering: line-art, size: default): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing hand gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"vs15\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:inherit\">🖖︎</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"vs15\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:inherit;margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖︎</span></span></p>\n<p>vs15 (rendering: line-art, size: extra-large): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"vs15\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem)\">🖖︎</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"vs15\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖︎</span></span></p>\n<p>emoji (size: small, skin tone: medium-light): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-light\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem)\">🖖🏼</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-light\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖🏼</span></span> </p>\n<p>emoji (medium, skin tone: medium-dark): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem)\">🖖🏾</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖🏾</span></span></p>\n<p>emoji (large, skin tone: dark): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem)\">🖖🏿</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖🏿</span></span></p>\n<p>emoji (extra-large, skin tone: medium-light): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-light\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem)\">🖖🏼</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-light\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖🏼</span></span> </p>\n<p>emoji (50%, skin tone: medium-dark): <span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing hand gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;width:50%;container-type:inline-size;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:42cqi\">🖖🏾</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"medium-dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:42cqi;margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖🏾</span></span> </p>\n<p>emoji (100%, skin tone: dark): </p>\n<span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing hand gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;width:100%;container-type:inline-size;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:42cqi\">🖖🏿</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"emoji\" data-skin-tone=\"dark\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:42cqi;margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖🏿</span></span>\n<span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute-pair\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Priestly Blessing hand gesture\" style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;width:100%;container-type:inline-size;\"><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"right\" data-rendering=\"vs15\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:42cqi\">🖖︎</span><span class=\"cvs-vulcan-salute\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hand=\"left\" data-rendering=\"vs15\" data-skin-tone=\"none\" style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1;font-size:42cqi;margin-inline-start:-0.15em;transform:scaleX(-1)\">🖖︎</span></span>\n",
